<section class="shell band faq">
  <h2>Consultation questions</h2>

  <details>
    <summary>Do these hours count toward EMDR certification?</summary>
    <div class="answer-body">
      <p>Yes. EMDRIA requires 20 consultation hours, at least 10 of them individual, and at
      least 5 from a full Approved Consultant rather than a Consultant in Training. Reem is a
      full Approved Consultant, so her hours count toward all of it. The table above has the
      rest of the requirements, and EMDRIA sets them, so confirm the current list with them.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>How much does EMDR consultation cost?</summary>
    <div class="answer-body">
      <p>$185 for an individual online hour. LPC Associates under Reem's supervision receive
      individual EMDR consults at no additional cost.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>I am not in Texas. Can we still work together?</summary>
    <div class="answer-body">
      <p>Consultation is a peer professional relationship rather than clinical care, so it is
      not limited to Texas in the way therapy and LPC supervision are. Check what your own
      licensing board expects of your consultation arrangements.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>What if my EMDR training was years ago?</summary>
    <div class="answer-body">
      <p>That is common and it is a fine place to start. Bring a case you feel stuck on and we
      will rebuild confidence from the preparation phases forward rather than starting from the
      manual.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

